# Subscription & IAP

- Package: `imdhemy/laravel-purchases`. Service chung: `SubscriptionService`. Per-provider: `GoogleService`, `AppleService`. Trial: `TrialService`.
- Logic CHUNG (activate/renew/cancel/expire/refund) ở `SubscriptionService` — KHÔNG lặp ở provider service.
- Provider service chỉ: verify token/receipt qua imdhemy, parse plan từ config, tạo/update record per-provider, gọi `SubscriptionService` cho phần chung.
- BẮT BUỘC `DB::transaction()` + `lockForUpdate()` cho mọi thao tác `subscriptions` table.
- BẮT BUỘC update đồng thời `users.subscription_status` + `users.plan` khi đổi subscription.
- Log: `Log::channel('subscription')` với context `user_id` + identifier provider (`purchase_token` / `receipt_id`).
- Exception: `app/Share/Exceptions/Subscription/` (base `SubscriptionException`). CẤM throw `\Exception` raw.
- Plan price + provider ID: `config('app_payment.plans.<key>')`. CẤM hardcode.
- Listener: mỗi event 1 file, extends `BaseGoogleListener` / `BaseAppleListener`.

